left-penniless-as-teen-after-sequel-tops-japanese-steam-charts-2000731076", "image_url": "https://kotaku.com/app/uploads/2026/09/mv_1920-1280x720.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Entertainment", "topic": "gaming", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Entertainment", "Kotaku", "en", "gaming", "text", "日语学习", "游戏"], "excerpt": "An unlikely game has made its way to the top of Steam’s bestsellers list in Japan: a strip mahjong game. Not only has Super Real Mahjong Venus Returns, the", "published_at": "2026-10-06T17:00:09Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-07T10:12:19Z", "body": "bodies/feed-9fff24baf536.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-b2389cb5dbe7", "title": "马斯克将旗下人工智能业务更名为 SpaceXSI；Altman 称 AI 发展应容忍一定风险；小米 Vision GT 将入驻《GT7》游戏｜极客早知道", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/372082", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/97/c3/97c3777f86ddef91f843ffa5b09b2a67.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "极客公园", "游戏", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n马斯克拟将 SpaceXAI 更名为 SpaceXSI 为「超级智能」概念背书\n\n\n美国总统特朗普推动以「超级智能」（Super Intelligence，简称 SI）取代「人工智能」（AI）的举措正在迅速影响科技行业。特斯拉和 SpaceX 首席执行官埃隆·马斯克日前表示，旗下人工智能业务品牌 SpaceXAI", "published_at": "2026-10-05T00:36:34Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-05T10:12:19Z", "body": "bodies/feed-b2389cb5dbe7.json", "engagement": 220, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-192bc1d1b66b", "title": "Food Delivery, Now Brought to You by AI", "source": "Bon Appétit", "author": "Sam Stone", "url": "https://www.bonappetit.com/story/food-delivery-now-brought-to-you-by-ai", "image_url": "https://assets.bonappetit.com/photos/6abead1b81124f7af54228a1/master/pass/GettyImages-2297314344.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Lifestyle", "topic": "food", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Bon Appétit", "Lifestyle", "en", "food", "text", "旅行探店", "科技"], "excerpt": "Welcome to Open Tab, a weekly roundup of the news, gossip, and stories that have stayed open in my tabs all week. Last time we covered the lesbian bar mask", "published_at": "2026-10-02T18:30:00Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-03T10:12:29Z", "body": "bodies/feed-192bc1d1b66b.json", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-7b54d0a83afb", "title": "特斯拉大涨！三季度全球交付量超预期，欧洲8月同比增长53%", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782939", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/39cb8b32-963e-4b1d-bc55-3758722e8257.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "旅行探店", "科技"], "excerpt": "特斯拉第三季度全球交付量超出分析师预期，为这家电动车制造商在市场承压时期提供了一个企稳信号，但同比仍录得下滑。\n\n特斯拉周五公布，三季度全球共交付486,532辆汽车，高于分析师平均预期463,761辆。欧洲特斯拉新车注册量出现明显回暖，中国市场销量同比回落。\n\n此次交付数据出炉，正值特斯拉经历了一段销量下滑与股价疲软", "published_at": "2026-10-02T14:12:37Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-03T10:12:29Z", "body": "bodies/feed-7b54d0a83afb.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-8538fd3b83b2", "title": "日本央行加息、特朗普警告都没用？对冲基金重新做空日元", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782958", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/9aaff202-2d72-4aaa-9174-7a3821f7dbc4.jpeg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资", "旅行探店"], "excerpt": "\n日本央行加息之后短暂出现的“做多日元”交易，正在迅速逆转。\n\n\n美国商品期货交易委员会（CFTC）最新数据显示，截至9月29日当周，杠杆基金重新转为净做空日元，相关看空押注规模约为2100亿日元（13亿美元）。\n\n\n更值得关注的不是空头规模本身，是对冲基金最近三周仓位变化的速度。\n\n\n两周前，对冲基金一度转向净做多日", "published_at": "2026-10-03T02:06:20Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-03T10:12:29Z", "body": "bodies/feed-8538fd3b83b2.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-fabd579d17c1", "title": "英伟达盘中创历史新高，市值逼近6万亿美元！对OpenAI 300亿美元投资收官", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782951", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/02782156-6781-4ec2-bfd3-2ecb93e1c97b.jpeg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资", "社会话题"], "excerpt": "英伟达股价在周五盘中刷新历史高点，距成为全球首家市值突破6万亿美元的上市公司仅一步之遥。这一反弹终结了一场历时两个月、蒸发逾1万亿美元市值的深度回调，并得到AI需求前景改善、巨额股票回购及宏观利率预期转变等多重利好的共同支撑。\n\n\n周五盘中，英伟达股价最高涨幅达约3%，刷新历史盘中高点，为今年5月以来首次；尾盘涨幅收窄", "published_at": "2026-10-02T21:56:25Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-03T10:12:29Z", "body": "bodies/feed-fabd579d17c1.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-572afd7cee13", "title": "早报｜曝苹果10月13日发布家庭中枢/豆包接入机票和火车票预订/东方甄选溜溜凳双倍退款", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "郑廷旭", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1682780?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/img_6abdac94c51ab.jpeg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "旅行探店", "爱范儿", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n曝苹果进军智能家居，拟于 10 月 13 日推出家庭中枢\n\n\niPhone 18 Pro 中国首销 3 天销量超上代首周，苹果周份额达 33%\n\n\nGoogle 发布 Gemini 4 Argon，先向网络防御者开放测试\n\n\n机构预计 iPhone Duo 年内销量约 600 万部\n\n\nDeepSeek", "published_at": "2026-10-01T00:43:49Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-01T10:12:23Z", "body": "bodies/feed-572afd7cee13.json", "engagement": 170, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-0e1266664dfd", "title": "别再把攻略全甩给 AI：国庆七天河南自驾，我是这样用 Agent 的", "source": "少数派", "author": "胡九思", "url": "https://sspai.com/post/114945", "imag