ands of hours exploring", "published_at": "2026-10-07T09:16:39Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-07T10:12:19Z", "body": "bodies/feed-12b06729d463.json", "engagement": 110, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-3a770f5d952e", "title": "13 Very Cool Food Gifts to Buy Before They Sell Out", "source": "Eater", "author": "", "url": "https://www.eater.com/shopping/920231/best-cool-food-gifts-that-will-sell-out-limited-edition", "image_url": "https://platform.eater.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/10/Cool-Gifts-That-Are-Going-to-Sell-Out-2026.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0,0,100,100", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Lifestyle", "topic": "food", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Eater", "Lifestyle", "en", "food", "text", "旅行探店"], "excerpt": "I’ve always considered fall the true annual reset, if not the soft launch of the upcoming holiday season. I know, I know — we’re still in the month of October,", "published_at": "2026-10-07T10:10:16Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-07T10:12:19Z", "body": "bodies/feed-3a770f5d952e.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-3b2c02d141ef", "title": "日本实际工资八连涨背后：补贴减税托底，破产潮与加息预期令央行两难", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783105", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/9e148f2e-dc78-4b23-a493-e262c8bc4745.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "旅行探店"], "excerpt": "日本8月实际工资连续第八个月上涨，创下近十年最长连涨纪录，工资-物价良性循环似乎正在成形。但拆解数据背后的支撑因素——政府补贴压低的通胀读数与即将落地的食品减税——这轮复苏的成色远比表面复杂。\n\n\n日本厚生劳动省周三公布，8月实际现金收入（剔除租金后的通胀调整值）同比增长1.5%，符合经济学家预期；基础工资增长3.8%", "published_at": "2026-10-07T05:44:32Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-07T10:12:19Z", "body": "bodies/feed-3b2c02d141ef.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-3caf9a5340b1", "titl